This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). It runs Qwen3.8-Flash-Next on one
Tenstorrent Blackhole p100a card plus the host CPU. It combines original code with code and formulas derived from the
third-party projects listed below.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Model weights: NOT included, NOT covered by the Apache License
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains no model weights and no files derived from them. At first start the server downloads, from
their publishers and at pinned revisions (tt_qwen38/sources.py), and builds the card caches on your machine:

* ISTA-DASLab/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-GSQ-RCO-Coder-GGUF (revision 5348543e) and ISTA-DASLab/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-GSQ-RCO-GGUF
  (revision ed59f920): GSQ-RCO quantizations of Qwen3.8-Flash-Next by ISTA-DASLab (the Coder keeps 256 of the 512
  routed experts).
* Lottolabs/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-Coder-P150 (revision 69e738b2): Lottolabs' GPTQ-BFP4 expert pool of the Coder.
* Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next (revision de4b8e4d): the 31 tensors of its MTP draft layer only, read by byte range.

